        <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #555; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">Paul was born in 1960 in Aberdeen Scotland of a Polish father and Scots Mother. With family connections in Poland, Paul travelled to Poland frequently with his family through the 60's, 70's and 80's. Paul was a founder member of the St. Andrews Foundation with Iain Leyden, Ben Bannatyne and Sandy McMillan in 2016. Paul is also a GlobalScot and has actively promoted Scotland throughout his time here and has supported the set-up of the now annual Scottish Day in Jadów.</p>
