        <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #555; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">Originally from Airdrie in North Lanarkshire, Iain was seconded to Poland in 2002. With the assistance of Martyn, Iain surprised Alex with a marriage proposal at the 2005 Caledonian Ball. Alex thought she had a winning Lottery Ticket but instead she got Iain! In 2015, Iain helped to set up the St Andrew's Foundation which raises donations to help worthwhile causes and has been organizing the annual charity ball which we all know and love.</p>
